4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mG0-eYhENcAQ7kNvwGdQrFL&_nc_oc=AdouIY970cNgOVhGqti559zs8MHrth6PmSdap7eO-ZDLaWzdPZVSA7ZfczJCZ3HeQD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_mAcTgxq3_boW_QiSP8m3gMmcPIANMSpIq9y7vhlwtjQ&oe=6A426D54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J4JyfnOTZXkQ7kNvwHM6KyM&_nc_oc=AdrmibO9Xl-jsDrfsHtQ98i7BRt7SeY0he7FmuCJaytO7IqDV-ZQ3Y2KVn9KnyOqZbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bYkZmxkh9kuMqDqZkCUD_ZkHShjCIA4JFPb3Rp-Gb4A&oe=6A427232"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkerRt8qCMUQ7kNvwECWuEW&_nc_oc=Adoj2-o-e6Hnwlqkwtx3pX2p4zXEdn-TS6RNUs-9H8ToAmiDtNKP6tITvzSyBthu9Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-zVgPCUqgSKtOZn2iX-u-3ZKlI7nTlrY0Xju6kIBAUrw&oe=6A427FD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p